==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
The Soldier's Helm is a part of the [[Soldier's Set]], in combination with the [[Soldier's Armor]] and [[Soldier's Greaves]]. It is sold at [[Ventest Clothing Boutique]] in [[Hateno Village]]. It can be [[Hateno Dye|Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]] and upgraded at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]]. It offers no effect aside from defense.

