==={{AoC|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
{{Descriptions AoC}}
The Soldier's Helm is a piece of [[Attire]] that can only be worn by [[Link]], which he has at the beginning of the game and can [[Dye]] at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]]. Soldier's Helms are worn by [[Hylian Captain]]s as well. [[Soldier]]s wear a similar headpiece, but without the plume.

